    <svg class="size-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z"/></svg>
    <span class="flex-1">Danh mục</span></a></li>
